# Responses shaped like a table get a Table view: CSV, JSON arrays of
# objects, and JSON objects that hold one (like "products" below). Sort by
# clicking a column, filter rows, and copy selected rows with ⌘C.

### GDP by country
GET https://raw.githubusercontent.com/datasets/gdp/main/data/gdp.csv

> assert status == 200
> assert text contains "Country Name"

### Products
GET {{dummyjson}}/products?limit=50&select=title,brand,category,price,rating,stock

> assert status == 200
> assert body.products.length == 50

### Users with addresses
# Nested objects become columns like address.city.
GET {{placeholder}}/users

> assert body.length == 10
